ss=\"col-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}}\">\n        <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/iced-rikka-black-tea-2201-1120x1570.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg item-wrapper\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"new-font\"><b>RIKKA / WAKOUCHA TEA</b></h5>\n        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          July 12-13, 2025\n        </h6>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Mix ingredients below in a measuring cup with ASAGAO / Chasen Whisk until no visible clumps:<br><br>a. Room temp / cold water – 75mL<br>b. Granulated sugar –2 tsp / 10mL Sugar Syrup (65mL water if sweetened)<br>c. RIKKA / Wakoucha Powder – 1g or ½ tsp<br><br>Pour the mixture above into a serving cup with 75mL of water with ice.</p>\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://www.nikonekomatcha.com/shop/rikka-wakoucha/\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Shop RIKKA / Wakoucha Powder<br></a></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n</section>",
